      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The default home world also appears to be affected by this issue. \n\nThe sound of campfires set up on rooftops is always loud no matter where i am.\n\nWhat device are you using?\n\nIPhone 15 pro 256GB\n\nWhat iOS version is installed?\n\n17.5.1\n\nWhat VRChat Build Number is installed? (You can find this in Testflight)\n\n2024.2.3 (333)\n\nWhat do you expected to happen?\n\nDefault Home world camp fire sound is too loud without distance fade out.\n\nWhat happens instead?\n\nSound fadeout or distance fade is working juke like a pc platform.\n\nDo you have screenshots or other helpful media?\n\nYes",
